!------------------------------------------------------------
! Validation of the external magnetic field implementation
!
! Uncomment ONE of the following undulator definitions.
! Both should produce equivalent results.
!------------------------------------------------------------

! Built-in analytical planar undulator
!UN 'planepole' 90 1.0 0.0 30 0.0 1.0 0.0 0.0

! External magnetic field imported from HDF5

UNF 'planar_validation.h5' 90 30


! The parameter for the external magnetic feild identifier UNF

! Name of the hdf5 file containing the field

! Number of periods in the undulator. 

! Number of intergration steps per period








